# Safety net: only the ENCRYPTED key (authkey.p8.enc) should ever be committed here. A raw .p8
# is the actual App Store Connect API private key — this rule makes it impossible to accidentally
# `git add` one, even with a broad `git add -A`, no matter what it's named.
*.p8
!*.p8.enc

# The plaintext ENCRYPTION_KEY password itself must never be committed either.
.encryption_key_SAVE_THIS_THEN_DELETE.txt
